* Synth-owned behavioural model for the AMS1117-3.3 fixed LDO.
* Limitations: ideal 3.3 V source with series output resistance; no dropout,
* no quiescent current, no transient, thermal or noise behaviour.
.subckt ams1117_3v3 vin gnd vout params: rout=50m
Vref vout int 3.3
Rout int gnd {rout}
.ends
